add rule inet filter output ip daddr $ip_fritzbox tcp dport $port_fritzbox_cabletv counter accept comment "Cable TV"
add rule inet filter input  ip saddr $ip_fritzbox tcp sport $port_fritzbox_cabletv ct state established counter accept comment "Cable TV"

add rule inet filter output ip daddr $ip_fritzbox udp dport $port_fritzbox_cabletv counter accept comment "Cable TV"
add rule inet filter input  ip saddr $ip_fritzbox udp sport $port_fritzbox_cabletv ct state established counter accept comment "Cable TV"

